nk it's really  nice to have another example of  tools to help people focus on  the specific apps for their businesses  and their end users um and you know kind  of delegate and get some help with the  stuff that is kind of common patterns so  um  hopefully you know you can let citrix  and google cloud help out with managing  some of that  please check out the links below  we have links to all the things that  rick mentioned and thank you so much for  joining us with this episode of  architecting with google cloud uh if you  want more please click and subscribe  [Music]

